> namely, every time I want to read in a .WAV file from the lab where I am
> currently doing an internship it gives me the following error: "Error in

> readWave("3C.wav") :* No data chunk found*". Furthermore, peculiar enough I

> do not get this error when I read in .WAV files obtained through opensource
